    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23346" root="شوق" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِيَاقٌ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  The <i>thing with which a thing is extended
in order to its being tied to a thing;</i> (O, K;) like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِيَاطٌ</span>; (S in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شيق</span>, O, TA;) originally. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِوَاقٌ</span>:
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِيقٌ</span></b> , originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِوْقٌ</span>, signifies the same.
(TA.)

